  "notes": "GAAP city. Governmental lines from the governmental funds statement Total Governmental Funds column (p5); business-type lines from the proprietary funds statement Total column (p7). Business-type receipts total has no single printed figure: operating 243,372 + nonoperating 1,657,967. Extraordinary item 'Major flood expenses' 592,576 (p7, also Statement of Activities p3) is deducted in the proprietary change in net assets; recorded as a negative business_type adjustment. ending_cash = governmental funds balance sheet 'Cash in bank' 119,540 (p4); restricted cash 576,799 printed separately and not added. Grant income has no grantor printed (category other, detail Grants). The only supplementary schedule is a combined all-funds budgetary basis statement (p10, mixes governmental and proprietary funds), so detail is per fund column of the governmental funds statement (p5) and proprietary funds statement (p7); proprietary nonoperating revenues, transfers and extraordinary item are printed only in the Total column and are not in detail. Read pages 1-10 of 10"
